      "versionNonce": 3338,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY A QUEUE: the processor accepts ~2k calls/s; 5k/s sent\ndirectly = 429s -> retries -> a retry storm (and the place\ndouble charges happen). Accept fast (202), queue, and drain\nat the processor's pace; retries only on 429 / 5xx, with\nbackoff + jitter. The shopper sees 'processing' for seconds.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHY A QUEUE: the processor accepts ~2k calls/s; 5k/s sent\ndirectly = 429s -> retries -> a retry storm (and the place\ndouble charges happen). Accept fast (202), queue, and drain\nat the processor's pace; retries only on 429 / 5xx, with\nbackoff + jitter. The shopper sees 'processing' for seconds.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
